{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, survive, and escape an island overrun by deadly machines. You play as a clever ferret stranded on an unknown island where every second counts.<i> Not My War</i> is a 3D isometric stealth and exploration game with a day-night cycle that turns time against you. Gather resources, help survivors, and repair your boat\u2026 while relentless robots patrol the island.<br><br><strong>Stealth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master stealth as you face<strong> unique enemies:</strong> ground-based, flying, and elusive. Each has<strong> sight or hearing detection</strong>, forcing you to plan every move carefully. Use <strong>gadgets</strong> and the environment to <strong>outsmart the machines </strong>and move unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/07af14e5c2e6beb7d653b9b037f4e14c.poster.avif?t=1762345011\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/07af14e5c2e6beb7d653b9b037f4e14c.webm?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/07af14e5c2e6beb7d653b9b037f4e14c.mp4?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is your greatest enemy. The day-night cycle <strong>changes patrols and encounters,</strong> forcing you to adapt your strategy. At night, the <strong>fog of war limits your vision</strong>, and the clock ticks toward an imminent explosion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/e28a10cc2a9f5f622340ad4235a8ab11.poster.avif?t=1762345011\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/e28a10cc2a9f5f622340ad4235a8ab11.webm?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/e28a10cc2a9f5f622340ad4235a8ab11.mp4?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an island devastated by the war between humans and robots and uncover its dark past through <strong>environmental storytelling</strong>. Find survivors and learn their stories, filled with memories and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/e68ef4766be1467c4653b98a6f87da1c.poster.avif?t=1762345011\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/e68ef4766be1467c4653b98a6f87da1c.webm?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/e68ef4766be1467c4653b98a6f87da1c.mp4?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and carefully manage essential resources in your <strong>grid-based inventory</strong>, where every slot counts. Find hidden materials in the world and use them to survive, repair your boat, and escape the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/993a53a2c8e620829c138f327fb14a9e.poster.avif?t=1762345011\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/993a53a2c8e620829c138f327fb14a9e.webm?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/993a53a2c8e620829c138f327fb14a9e.mp4?t=1762345011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project made for 24Pack Studios in U-tad, University of Technology, Arts and Design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/08a98d916d37b04a012ecf56ea939a87.avif?t=1762345011\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras/ad799368acf4105c429ae7ffbff31e10.avif?t=1762345011\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/extras_big/ad799368acf4105c429ae7ffbff31e10.webp?t=1762345011 width=1560 height=247 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034810?t=1762345011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/309fd76d9a66bb65c9eb62b9fe339b7dab79ca6f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762345011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/9d1c581e0530fe764104e128ebca4c0307405491/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762345011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034810/9d1c581e0530fe764104e128ebca4c0307405491/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762345011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descrip